<title>SINGAPORE: TABLE - BAT first half net down 24 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE - BAT first half net down 24 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30 1997</p>
<p>(in millions of Singapore dollars unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit	     13.09  vs  17.21</p>
<p>    Group share (cents)	  14.50  vs  19.10</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)	     13.50  vs  17.00</p>
<p>    Turnover			129.46  vs 159.26</p>
<p>    Operating profit	     23.15  vs  28.75</p>
<p>    Pretax			   18.39  vs  24.10</p>
<p>    Tax				 5.30  vs   6.89</p>
<p>Note - British American Tobacco Company Singapore Ltd said turnover dropped due to lower contract manufacturing. It expects profit in the second half to be comparable.</p>
